@page "/about"

<div class="container">
    <div class="row pt-5 justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-lg-12 mb-3">
            <h1>About</h1>

            <p>Movie Collection is a personal portfolio project developed to demonstrate full-stack web development skills using C#, ASP.NET Core, Blazor, Entity Framework Core, and PostgreSQL.</p>

            <p>The application allows users to search for movies, view movie information, and manage a collection of their favorite films.</p>

            <p>Movie information and associated images are provided by The Movie Database (TMDB).</p>

            <p>This application is intended for educational and portfolio demonstration purposes only. It is not a commercial product and is not affiliated with or endorsed by any movie studios or distributors.</p>

            <p>Disclaimer: This product uses the TMDB API but is not endorsed or certified by TMDB.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>